  "notes": "Compound of {開|かい} (to open) + {花|か} (flower).\n\nSENSE 1 (flowering):\nThe {桜|さくら}の{開花|かいか}{宣言|せんげん} (cherry blossom bloom announcement) is an eagerly awaited event each spring. The Japan Meteorological Agency tracks {開花|かいか}{前線|ぜんせん} (the bloom front) as it moves northward.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS (sense 1):\n- {開花|かいか}{宣言|せんげん} (bloom announcement)\n- {開花|かいか}{予想|よそう} (bloom forecast)\n- {開花|かいか}{時期|じき} (flowering season)\n\nSENSE 2 (figurative):\nUsed for talent, ability, or potential reaching full expression.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS (sense 2):\n- {才能|さいのう}が{開花|かいか}する (talent blossoms)\n- {能力|のうりょく}が{開花|かいか}する (ability blooms)",
